 ## Subtopics
 
+### [Offset-Aware Remeshing](19921-offset-aware-remeshing.md)
+A remeshing algorithm tailored to offset surfaces that uses normal deviation instead of edge length or approximation error to drive mesh operations, ensuring feature preservation and high-quality elements [G].
